<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong><%= @name %></strong> (<%= @requester.email %>) asked for access to <strong><%= @title %></strong> on <%= APP_NAME %>. You manage this show there, so they reached you through us.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If they work on the show with you, reply to this email: your reply goes straight to them. If you don't know them, ignore it. Nothing changes on your show either way.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">We haven't shared your name or email with them. To hand the show over to them, write to us at hello@midrolo.com.</p>
<%= mail_button "Open your listing", edit_show_media_kit_url(@podcast.owner_show) %>
<%= mail_footnote "We send this when someone asks for access to a show you manage." %>
